    "section": "23. Aircraft",
    "ruleNumber": "23.04",
    "summary": "**[AIRCRAFT](vsdata:core-rule/aircraft)** units cannot declare a charge, and their melee attacks can target only **[FLYING](vsdata:core-rule/flying-models)** units. In turn, only **FLYING** units can pick **AIRCRAFT** units as charge targets, and only **FLYING** models may attack them in melee.",
